# {title}

Shared documentation, design docs and changelogs for the repos in this workspace. The rules for using this hub are in the "Working habits" section of the workspace `CLAUDE.md`. **Start here, then go to the repo you are working in.**

## Map

| Section | What is in it |
|---|---|
| [projects/](projects/README.md) | One folder per repo. Start with `projects/<repo>/INDEX.md` |
| [knowledge-base/](knowledge-base/README.md) | What crosses repos: conventions, permissions, environments, known issues, glossary |
| [design/](design/README.md) | Design docs, one folder per feature. Template in `design/_template.md` |
| [changelog/](changelog/README.md) | One folder per repo, one file per day: `changelog/<repo>/YYYY-MM-DD.md` |

